    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23深圳）老杨、老朱和小张三人开展社区巡防工作，巡防路线固定，三人同时同向出发，老杨开车，老朱骑自行车，小张走路。已知老杨每20分钟追上小张一次，每40分钟追上老朱一次，则老朱每（）分钟追上小张一次。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "30"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "40"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "50"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "60"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          77
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          71
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-03-p077.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（二） · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第71页",
            "pdfPage": 77
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把一圈设为L。老杨比小张快L/20，比老朱快L/40。两式相减，老朱比小张快L/20－L/40＝L/40。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "老朱每追回一圈需要L÷(L/40)＝40分钟，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "追及频率对应速度差，不是把两个追及时间直接相减。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
